// `TooHeavy` is raised by the shared `portions` library and by
// `pantry`'s `restock`, so it lives in `shared/failures/`: code in
// `shared/` can't depend on any one domain, and a failure raised in more
// than one place belongs to none of them. `sales` only passes it on,
// from `portions`.

/// A weight would pass the 100 kilograms the scales can weigh.
type TooHeavy = Failure {
    kind: FailureKind.invalid_value
}
